  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice cucumber into half moons.\n• Trim and halve pea pods lengthways.\n• Cut lime into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b06f1818d9f25cca80da5/step-3bd7e100.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b06f1818d9f25cca80da5/step-d7c46e10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a large bowl, combine sweet chilli sauce, a good squeeze of lime juice and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Add pea pods, cucumber and mixed salad leaves to the dressing, tossing to coat. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b06f1818d9f25cca80da5/step-a6d42320.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice plant-based crumbed chicken.\n• Divide seared plant-based crumbed chicken and zingy green salad between plates.\n• Garnish with crispy shallots. Serve with remaining lime wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b06f1818d9f25cca80da5/step-6b9e8e30.jpg"
    }
  ]
